flowchart TD
  X[Normative specification] --> F[Defines feature]
  R[Official registry] --> L[Registry-listed role/components]
  D[First-party surface docs] --> DOC[Documented assertion]
  N[Release note] --> DOC
  I[Reproducible issue] --> REP[Reported incident / contradiction]
  TEST[Signed release-pinned run] --> VER[Independently tested assertion]
  F --> CELL[Compatibility cell]
  L --> CELL
  DOC --> CELL
  REP --> CELL
  VER --> CELL
  CELL --> Q{Evidence conflict or gate?}
  Q -- yes --> P[Partial / contradiction / scoped profiles]
  Q -- no --> S[Supported or explicit unsupported]
  NONE[No defensible evidence] --> U[Unknown]
